OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AControversial Jackdaw gas field set to
OL,4,Abe approved in weeks, sources say
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe gas field was approved by the
OL,7,Fformer Conservative government in 2022
OL,8,Fbut was delayed by a legal ruling from
OL,9,Fa Scottish court, after environmental
OL,10,Fgroups successfully argued that consent
OL,11,Fwas given without fully considering the
OL,12,Fclimate impact.
OL,14,FJackdaw's owner says it will provide
OL,15,Fgas to supply up to 6% of the UK's
OL,16,Fdemand at peak production, but
OL,17,Fenvironmental groups say it will only
OL,18,Fsupply 2%.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
