OL,3,ATransplanted pig kidney works in US
OL,4,Aman's body for record 271 days
OL,5,
OL,6,FA kidney transplanted from a pig has
OL,7,Fworked inside a patient for 271 days `
OL,8,Fthe longest on record, say US doctors.
OL,10,FTim Andrews said the transplant gave
OL,11,Fhim "hope" and spared him months of
OL,12,Fneeding to go to hospital to have his
OL,13,Fblood filtered by a dialysis machine.
OL,15,FThe team at Mass General Brigham
OL,16,Fhospital say their work shows pig
OL,17,Forgans can be used as a "bridge" until
OL,18,Fa human transplant becomes available.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
