OL,3,ATransplanted pig kidney works in US
OL,4,Aman's body for record 271 days
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the pig organ eventually failed and
OL,7,Fwas removed so Andrews needed a short
OL,8,Fbout of dialysis before a donor was
OL,9,Ffound.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
